‎with the first song I ever wrote.

240
00:14:37,751 --> 00:14:41,087
‎We love you all, our RGB Army!

241
00:14:41,088 --> 00:14:43,340
‎#1 "SHOUT IT OUT" BY TRIANGLE

242
00:14:44,425 --> 00:14:47,844
‎We'll continue to work hard
‎to bring you even better music.

243
00:14:47,845 --> 00:14:50,890
‎We won't let you down. Thank you.

244
00:14:52,266 --> 00:14:54,893
‎Now, we'll wrap up the show
‎with Triangle's encore performance.

245
00:14:54,894 --> 00:14:57,145
