<i>‎Number 2 for 39 weeks straight?</i>

274
00:16:23,983 --> 00:16:25,358
<i>‎Number one, Choi Seong-gon.</i>

275
00:16:25,359 --> 00:16:27,610
<i>‎-You're the prince.
