281
00:16:42,042 --> 00:16:43,168
‎Our money.

282
00:16:43,836 --> 00:16:46,254
‎Come on, our money.
‎Did you have the money talk with him?

283
00:16:46,255 --> 00:16:48,214
‎Why are you on my case about this?

284
00:16:48,215 --> 00:16:50,383
‎Because you're the leader.

285
00:16:50,384 --> 00:16:51,468
‎Hey, Hyun-woo.

286
00:16:52,344 --> 00:16:54,053
