300
00:17:28,839 --> 00:17:29,757
‎It's Tae-poong.

301
00:17:33,093 --> 00:17:33,969
‎Na Tae-poong.

302
00:17:34,553 --> 00:17:38,682
‎Why don't you go by Jang-poong instead?
‎It's a better name.

303
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:41,101
‎That's a great idea.

304
00:17:41,685 --> 00:17:42,519
‎Right?

305
00:17:47,524 --> 00:17:49,442
‎Congratulations, man. You were amazing.

306
00:17:49,443 --> 00:17:51,945
‎Seriously, you looked really cool.

307
