‎Hello, Mr. Park.

308
00:17:57,534 --> 00:17:58,535
‎I'm Megaton's Na--

309
00:18:00,746 --> 00:18:02,789
‎My babies, why are you sitting around?

310
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:04,207
‎Go party it up and have fun.

311
00:18:04,208 --> 00:18:06,168
‎Well, Mr. Park...

312
00:18:07,252 --> 00:18:09,546
‎About what we talked about the other day.

313
00:18:10,172 --> 00:18:11,256
‎The payout?

314
00:18:11,882 --> 00:18:15,468
‎We still haven't gotten any payout
‎from our first album last year.

315
00:18:15,469 --> 00:18:18,722
‎You know how it is.
‎These things take time.

316
00:18:19,431 --> 00:18:22,768
‎You see, it's just how the system works.

317
00:18:24,186 --> 00:18:26,437
‎Your payouts have just been deferred.

318
00:18:26,438 --> 00:18:30,191
‎From an accounting perspective,
‎your money's in circulation right now.

319
00:18:30,192 --> 00:18:32,152
‎I'm getting a call. I'll be right back.

320
00:18:33,987 --> 00:18:34,988
‎Damn it.

321
00:18:36,365 --> 00:18:37,573
‎You saw that, right?

322
00:18:37,574 --> 00:18:39,660
‎I spoke up as the leader.

323
00:18:40,285 --> 00:18:41,911
‎If I don't get my payout,

324
00:18:41,912 --> 00:18:45,124
‎I'm coming for you first. You got that?

325
00:19:08,230 --> 00:19:10,607
‎Hey, why didn't you guys
‎answer your phones?

326
00:19:11,108 --> 00:19:12,442
