‎have a few drinks and have fun.

331
00:19:26,248 --> 00:19:27,499
‎Jeez, that's gross!

332
00:19:28,250 --> 00:19:29,959
‎What the... My gosh.

333
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:32,254
‎What is that? Has he lost his mind?

334
00:19:33,547 --> 00:19:35,756
‎Wait, this idiot...

335
00:19:35,757 --> 00:19:37,675
