342
00:19:52,232 --> 00:19:55,152
<i>‎-Last night, Mr. Choi...</i>
‎-Did you two take anything?

343
00:19:58,197 --> 00:19:59,447
‎You took something, didn't you?

344
00:19:59,448 --> 00:20:01,532
‎You did. I can totally tell!

345
00:20:01,533 --> 00:20:04,243
‎Hey, he took something.
‎This prick took something too.

346
00:20:04,244 --> 00:20:06,580
‎Come on, man.
‎I don't even take herbal medicine.

347
00:20:07,164 --> 00:20:10,459
‎I knew that idiot was bad news,
‎even down to his hair parting.

348
00:20:13,128 --> 00:20:14,755
‎Hey, did you get it sorted out?

349
00:20:17,174 --> 00:20:20,843
<i>‎The popular co-ed group Triangle has been
‎caught up in plagiarism allegations.</i>

350
00:20:20,844 --> 00:20:21,761
