<i>‎Let's take a listen.</i>

354
00:20:30,812 --> 00:20:41,739
<i>‎Shout it out</i>

355
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:43,992
‎I don't hear any similarities, do you?

356
00:20:46,787 --> 00:20:48,914
‎The first one was our song, right?

357
00:20:50,749 --> 00:20:51,958
‎No, the second one.

358
00:20:51,959 --> 00:20:53,168
‎Or was it the first one?

359
00:20:54,086 --> 00:20:55,628
‎They sounded identical.

360
00:20:55,629 --> 00:21:00,425
<i>‎Triangle's agency, Yonggu Records,
‎has yet to release an official statement...</i>

361
00:21:03,553 --> 00:21:05,347
‎What a beautiful day.

362
00:21:06,348 --> 00:21:07,766
‎The day I first met you,

363
00:21:08,308 --> 00:21:10,352
