365
00:21:15,190 --> 00:21:17,483
‎No, you can't leave.
‎You need to sort this mess out!

366
00:21:17,484 --> 00:21:18,652
‎Adios.

367
00:21:19,361 --> 00:21:20,487
‎Hello?

368
00:21:23,573 --> 00:21:25,575
‎Don't take this the wrong way
‎and hear me out.

369
00:21:26,493 --> 00:21:28,119
‎It's not just because of what's happened.

370
00:21:28,120 --> 00:21:32,039
‎I was starting to feel
‎a lot of limitations being in a group,

371
00:21:32,040 --> 00:21:33,292
