01:46:08,820 --> 01:46:10,738
<i>‎Trash piling up
‎From reckless overconsumption</i>

1808
01:46:10,739 --> 01:46:13,282
<i>‎The selective comfort of those
‎Who live only for today</i>

1809
01:46:13,283 --> 01:46:15,785
<i>‎It's destroying you and me, all of us here</i>

1810
01:46:15,786 --> 01:46:17,828
<i>‎One, two, three, four, my peace</i>

1811
01:46:17,829 --> 01:46:20,581
<i>‎Hang it up, hang it up, now</i>

1812
01:46:20,582 --> 01:46:22,750
<i>‎The world I created</i>

1813
01:46:22,751 --> 01:46:25,336
<i>‎Is coming back to get me</i>

1814
01:46:25,337 --> 01:46:27,505
<i>‎Living for today is</i>

1815
01:46:27,506 --> 01:46:30,382
<i>‎My promise to protect it</i>

1816
01:46:30,383 --> 01:46:34,970
<i>‎Can you hear me?</i>

1817
01:46:34,971 --> 01:46:37,139
<i>‎Nothing lasts forever</i>

1818
01:46:37,140 --> 01:46:39,934
<i>‎Don't run from the uncomfortable truth</i>

1819
01:46:39,935 --> 01:46:44,355
<i>‎Can you hear me?</i>

1820
